<title>UK: Merrill sets calls on Royal Dutch Petroleum.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets calls on Royal Dutch Petroleum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co has issued 750,000 American-style call warrants, on Royal Dutch Petroleum Company, lead manager Morgan Stanley International Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    350 DFL		   PREMIUM	9.43 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     30.8 DFL		  GEARING	11.29 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	11.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  348.5 DFL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
